{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"RuleBuilder","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/RuleBuilder","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto11RuleBuildera"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"topics","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actor","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"intents","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Intent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Intent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto6IntentV"},{"text":"] = [.ask, .tell], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fallback","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"again","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"TopicBuilder","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/TopicBuilder","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:18GnustoConversation12TopicBuildera"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"entries","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": () -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"TopicEntry","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/TopicEntry","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18GnustoConversation10TopicEntryV"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Rules","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5RulesV"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Whose table this is. Rows fire only when this actor is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one being addressed.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"actor"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The conversation intents the table answers. Defaults to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ASK and TELL; pass a game’s own verb to reuse one table for it.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"intents"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What the actor says when nothing matches. Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default) to stay quiet and let the next rule — another table, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"GnustoActors","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reaction, or this layer’s own default — answer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"fallback"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What the actor says when the player raises a subject they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"have already been given in full. Opt-in and per-row overridable:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"see the rules below.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"again"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The rows, most specific first.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"entries"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The before-phase rules, for the host’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"type":"text","text":" block."}]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Conversations"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One rule is registered per intent, each scanning the whole table. That"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is what makes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fallback:"},{"type":"text","text":" expressible at all — a per-row rule cannot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"know that no later row matched."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Saying it once","anchor":"Saying-it-once"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A row with no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"again:"},{"type":"text","text":" — neither its own nor the table’s — repeats"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forever and records nothing, exactly as before this parameter existed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A game that never writes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"again:"},{"type":"text","text":" produces byte-identical saves."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"again:"},{"type":"text","text":" retires "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"reply:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rows only","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":" row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opts in by naming a line of its own, because its body can move the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world and adding a default to a table must never change what the world"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"does","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", only what is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"said","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":" row that does name one runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its body once; the repeat is the line alone."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A row that has been heard still "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"matches","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and still owns its keyword."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It never falls through to a later row or to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fallback:"},{"type":"text","text":" — an actor who"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"demonstrably has an answer should not sound blank about the subject."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Gating composes for free: a lie and the confession that replaces it are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"different rows with different keys, tracked apart."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A repeat costs a turn, like any other answer."}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Conversation\/topics(of:for:fallback:again:_:)"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"topics","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Intent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto6IntentV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fallback","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"again","kind":"externalParam"},{"text